                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Suggested final clause in Article IV</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The colonial treasury shall continue to pay the yearly allowances now given to
                    heretofore removed functionaries appointed in the islands but holding no royal
                    commission, unless those allowances may have until now been paid in Denmark.</p>
            </div>
